questions.question:
Consider a program given below for the selection of the largest of numbers.

```c
void main()
{
   float a,b,c;
   printf("Enter three values\n");
   scanf("%f%f %f", &a,&b,&c);
   printf("\n Largest value is");
   if(a>b){
      if(a>c)
         printf("%f\n",a);
      else
         printf("%f\n",c);
   }
   else{
      if(c>b)
         printf("%f\n",c);
      else
         printf("%f\n",b);
   }
}
```

Design equivalence class testing and decision table testing techniques for the above program.

